  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="8a6dc5b3-534b-5d2f-9fdb-93d85b0c5c48" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="Execute sequential tasks with explicit ALLOW/READY outcomes, wait, retry and failure paths.&#10;Require 1 through 30 seats and nonblank courseCode; request replay preserves one identity.&#10;ValidateRequest -&gt; ALLOW/DENY -&gt; AllocateWorkspace -&gt; CreateManifest -&gt; five-second wait -&gt; VerifyWorkspace -&gt; READY/FAILED.&#10;Task results retain request identity at $.stepResults; evaluator tasks return explicit outcome envelopes and unknown values fail.&#10;Stable task identities prevent duplicate workspace/manifest; failures remain visible for authorized recovery, without automatic compensation.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
